text ......
text I wake up.
text I must've dozed off without realizing it...
text My plan was just to lie down and not go to sleep, but...
text I grab my watch and bring it to my face.
text It's so early I can barely call it morning.
text I wake up feeling an odd sensation. Right as I try to go back to sleep, a chill runs through my body.
text That finally makes me realize.
text ...Didn't I just wake up because of some sound?
text As soon as I think this, I get an awful feeling.
text I rise from the floor.
text At this hour though, it wouldn't be unusual for them to be getting bread ready to bake.
text So, yeah... That sound must have been made by Nagisa's old man.
text I tell myself this in order to calm down.
setvar strS[1000] = "BG006"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
