text I reach the living room.
text There... I see the small shape of someone's back.
music BGM18A.mp3
text It's... Nagisa's back.
text She turns around to face me as I stand there.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG34E"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
