fi
sound KYL.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Tomoya-kun...
text @[Tomoya]
text Wait... Don't tell me you were awake this whole time...
text @[Tomoya]
text Tomorrow's your big day... What're you doing...?
sound KYM.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Tomoya-kun, I want you to listen.
text Things have been scattered all across the floor.
text Albums, notebooks, and more.
sound KYN.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text ...
sound KYO.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I didn't know.
text I'm afraid to hear what she has to say next.
text @[Tomoya]
text Nagisa, you don't need to think about this.
text @[Tomoya]
text Just get some rest for now.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'll be sure to wake you up in the morning.
text @[Tomoya]
text And after that, we can go to school together like we always do.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'll stand by your side as you read your script and practice.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'll be there, listening to you.
text @[Tomoya]
text Okay, Nagisa?
text @[Tomoya]
text Here, I'll even take you to your room.
