text @[Akio]
text And she was that excited to be going to school...
sound KYV.aac
text @[Akio]
text Dammit...!
text I never imagined that this guy, of all people, could become this sad.
text @[Tomoya]
text Old man...
text I search for words to tell him.
choice You're a good father|You're a failure as a father
