text ...There aren't many guys out there like you.
text @[Tomoya]
text And if you give her time, I'm sure she'll realize that too.
text @[Tomoya]
text But... there's something today that Nagisa and I have been working hard toward.
text @[Tomoya]
text I want to see that through.
