text I've been a failure ever since that day twelve years ago...
sound KZ1.aac
text @[Akio]
text Like you'd understand.
sound KZ2.aac
text @[Akio]
text You have no idea how much we've suffered and how hard we've worked since then...
sound KZ3.aac
text @[Akio]
text Not to mention the joy we've felt...
sound KZ4.aac
text @[Akio]
text How dare you tell me that without having shared in all we've gone through...
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah...
text @[Tomoya]
text But I've been the closest person to her over this past month...
text @[Tomoya]
text Even closer than you two...
