text I walk up the small staircase from the green room and head to the side of the stage.
text There I find Nagisa, in costume.
text @[Tomoya]
text Nagisa!
text I call out to her.
text When she turns around to look at me, I give her a thumbs up.
text Nagisa nods back at me, expressionless.
text Then she turns back and faces forward.
text The crowd is applauding.
text It's our turn.
text Nagisa walks out from the wing to center stage.
text Sanae-san's handmade costume is still distinguishable from this far off.
text The building becomes animated with the girl's appearance.
text Some shrill screams fill the air as well.
text I can even hear some of the festival organizers talking behind me, asking each other what class the cute girl they're seeing is in.
text I feel proud.
text Nagisa bows.
