text She stays silent for a long while.
text While the audience thinks that this is part of the play at first, the silence is so long that they start to feel something strange is happening.
text This eventually turns into a stir that spreads throughout the building.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text I fix my gaze upon the girl surrounded by light.
text Please, Nagisa... act.
text I begin to pray.
text ──"It really is my fault that they gave up on their dreams."
text ──"And now..."
text ──"I'm trying to make my own dreams come true... at the cost of theirs..."
text I think I see Nagisa's mouth faintly move.
