text And then... she begins to cry.
text The tears she held back for so long finally begin to flow down her cheeks.
text She cries like a child, hiccuping.
text I've never seen her in this much pain.
text She's living her own life at the cost of other peoples' dreams.
text The pain she's feeling comes from not knowing how to react after being confronted with such a truth.
text She's in pain because she has lost everything that once supported her.
